From: Smartisan ODIN mainline porting effort
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] msm8953: drop markw and rosy from the device table

Force lk2nd to pick the Smartisan ODIN entry.

Why this is needed: the table holds both msm8953-smartisan-odin (board-id
<0x0b 0x01>) and msm8953-xiaomi-markw (<0x1000b 0x01>). VARIANT_MASK is 0xff,
so both have variant_id 0x0b -- the 0x10 nibble is only the variant *major*,
which loses to SUBTYPE_EXACT_MATCH. Both carry subtype 0x01, so the tie-break
falls through to comparing variant_major, and markw can win.

markw requires an exact major match while odin only needs MAJOR_BEST, so once
markw is gone odin is the only SUBTYPE_EXACT candidate left and wins outright.

This patch builds the "nomarkw" image.
Apply only 0001-0003 for the full (untrimmed) image.

Generated against lk2nd 23.1 —— 实测确认 23.1 在本机可启动且能正确替换面板 compatible。
diff --git a/lk2nd/device/dts/msm8953/rules.mk b/lk2nd/device/dts/msm8953/rules.mk
index 32b8f48..86c3729 100644
--- a/lk2nd/device/dts/msm8953/rules.mk
+++ b/lk2nd/device/dts/msm8953/rules.mk
@@ -19,14 +19,12 @@ ADTBS += \
 	$(LOCAL_DIR)/msm8953-wingtech-wt89536.dtb \
 	$(LOCAL_DIR)/msm8953-xiaomi-common.dtb \
 	$(LOCAL_DIR)/msm8953-xiaomi-daisy.dtb \
-	$(LOCAL_DIR)/msm8953-xiaomi-markw.dtb \
 	$(LOCAL_DIR)/msm8953-xiaomi-oxygen.dtb \
 	$(LOCAL_DIR)/msm8953-xiaomi-vince.dtb \
 	$(LOCAL_DIR)/sda450-samsung-r05.dtb \
 	$(LOCAL_DIR)/sdm450-motorola-ali.dtb \
